                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nikamwendea malaika yule nikamwambia kwamba anipe kile kitabu kidogo. Akaniambia, Kitwae, ukile, nacho kitakutia uchungu tumboni mwako, bali katika kinywa chako kitakuwa kitamu kama asali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikakitwaa kile kitabu kidogo kutoka mkononi mwa malaika yule, nikakila; nacho kikawa kitamu kama asali kinywani mwangu, na nilipokwisha kukila tumbo langu likatiwa uchungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
